            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="figure-label" facs="#f01-drawing">
              <label>人體圖右下，外側直註</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">□□是從此上肩</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="figure-label" facs="#f01-drawing">
              <label>人體圖右下，中間直註</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">肝□入了一口氣勢進不動</seg>
            </ab>
            <ab type="page-feature" subtype="figure-label" facs="#f01-drawing">
              <label>人體圖右下，內側直註</label>
              <seg type="diplomatic-text" rend="unknown">□針□□</seg>
